OL,3,AUS removes all bombers from RAF
OL,4,AFairford base
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men were initially arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of terror offences near the
OL,8,Fbase and subsequently released on bail.
OL,9,FA sixth man, a UK-Iranian national, was
OL,10,Falso later arrested and released on
OL,11,Fbail.
